src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:119:returns the manager to `idle`, so exploration or coverage can be started again.
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:121:`coverage/reset` clears the coverage tracker map, planner path/markers, and
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:122:FollowPath cache, then closes the active coverage launch and returns the manager
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:123:to `idle`. A new coverage run must start again with
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:124:`/sweepi_robot_manager/start_coverage`, followed by validate and start.
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:132:When coverage reaches a final status after any cleanup pass, the manager records
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:133:the used map, final coverage status, elapsed time, latest `/coverage_stats`, and
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:134:latest `/coverage_map` cell summary. It then stops the coverage launch stack and
src/sweepi_robot_manager/README.md:135:returns to `idle`, so another exploration or coverage task can be started.
